<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="description" content="Nick Taylor — Full-Stack Engineer.">
    <title>Nick Taylor | Full-Stack Engineer</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/homepage.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
    <script src="/js/header.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>
    <main>
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <div class="hero-status">
                    <span class="hero-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="hero-wide-copy">Available for Full-Stack Roles</span>
                    <span class="hero-mobile-copy">Available for Roles</span>
                </div>
                <h1 id="hero-heading">Architecting scalable web systems with <span class="hero-highlight"><span class="hero-wide-copy">TypeScript</span><span class="hero-mobile-copy">TS</span> &amp; Node.js</span><span class="hero-desktop-copy">.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-description hero-desktop-copy">Full-stack software engineer specializing in high-throughput Node.js microservices, TypeScript architecture, and high-performance web frontends. Delivering resilient distributed backends and refined user experiences.</p>
                <p class="hero-description hero-tablet-copy">Full-stack engineer specializing in high-throughput Node.js microservices, deterministic event queues, and resilient frontends that gracefully handle millions of distributed requests.</p>
                <p class="hero-description hero-mobile-copy">Full-stack software engineer delivering resilient Node.js backends and responsive web interfaces.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="hero-button hero-button-primary" role="link" aria-disabled="true" title="Projects coming soon">
                        View Projects
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16m-7-7 7 7 7-7"/></svg>
                    </a>
                    <a class="hero-button hero-button-secondary" role="link" aria-disabled="true" title="Contact coming soon">
                        Contact Me
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="1"/><path d="m3 6 9 7 9-7"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="expertise" id="skills" aria-labelledby="expertise-heading">
            <div class="expertise-heading">
                <div class="expertise-eyebrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1"/><path d="M9 2v4m6-4v4M9 18v4m6-4v4M2 9h4m-4 6h4m12-6h4m-4 6h4"/></svg><span>Core Competencies</span></div>
                <h2 id="expertise-heading">Technical Expertise</h2>
                <p>Architected around modern JavaScript runtime standards, deterministic typing, and horizontal cloud scale.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="expertise-grid expertise-desktop">
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M8 21h8m-4-5v5"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Frontend</h3></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Component-driven interfaces prioritizing sub-second FCP, modular state, and pixel precision.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>React / Next.js</li>
                        <li>TypeScript</li>
                        <li>Tailwind CSS</li>
                        <li>Web Components</li>
                        <li>Performance Optimization</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="18" height="7" rx="1"/><path d="M7 6h1m-1 11h1"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Backend &amp; Runtime</h3></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Asynchronous microservices, message queues, and high-throughput event engines.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>Node.js / Express</li>
                        <li>Fastify Framework</li>
                        <li>REST &amp; GraphQL APIs</li>
                        <li>WebSockets &amp; Streams</li>
                        <li>Microservices Arch</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 4 16 4 16 0V5M4 12c0 4 16 4 16 0"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Databases &amp; Caching</h3></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Normalized data stores, in-memory caches, and deterministic transaction isolation.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>PostgreSQL (ACID)</li>
                        <li>Redis Caching &amp; Queues</li>
                        <li>MongoDB / Document Store</li>
                        <li>Prisma / TypeORM</li>
                        <li>Query Optimization</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>DevOps &amp; Tooling</h3></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Automated pipelines, immutable container orchestration, and telemetry visibility.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>Docker Containers</li>
                        <li>AWS (ECS, S3, CloudFront)</li>
                        <li>Git / GitHub Actions CI/CD</li>
                        <li>Jest / Playwright</li>
                        <li>Linux &amp; NGINX</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="expertise-grid expertise-tablet">
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M8 21h8m-4-5v5"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Frontend Architecture</h3><span class="expertise-subtitle">State Machines &amp; Micro-UIs</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Engineered around reactive state isolation, zero-layout-shift performance, and accessible interactive primitives.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>React 19</li>
                        <li>Next.js (App Router)</li>
                        <li>TypeScript</li>
                        <li>Tailwind CSS</li>
                        <li>Web Components</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="18" height="7" rx="1"/><path d="M7 6h1m-1 11h1"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Backend &amp; Runtime</h3><span class="expertise-subtitle">Event-Driven Services</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Specialized in event-loop tuning, non-blocking asynchronous I/O pipelines, and microservice RPC boundaries.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>Node.js (v20+ LTS)</li>
                        <li>Fastify</li>
                        <li>Express</li>
                        <li>REST &amp; GraphQL</li>
                        <li>WebSockets</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 4 16 4 16 0V5M4 12c0 4 16 4 16 0"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Databases &amp; Caching</h3><span class="expertise-subtitle">Relational &amp; In-Memory</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Strict transactional consistency, query index optimizations, and multi-tier read-through Redis caches.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>PostgreSQL</li>
                        <li>Redis Cluster</li>
                        <li>MongoDB</li>
                        <li>Prisma ORM</li>
                        <li>Drizzle</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>DevOps &amp; Tooling</h3><span class="expertise-subtitle">CI/CD &amp; Infrastructure</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <p>Continuous integration delivery gates, containerization, end-to-end integration test harnesses, and AWS deployment.</p>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>Docker</li>
                        <li>AWS ECS / Lambda</li>
                        <li>GitHub Actions</li>
                        <li>Jest &amp; Playwright</li>
                        <li>Terraform</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="expertise-grid expertise-mobile">
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M8 21h8m-4-5v5"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Frontend</h3></div>
                        <span class="expertise-subtitle">Client Architecture</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>React</li>
                        <li>TypeScript</li>
                        <li>Tailwind</li>
                        <li>Next.js</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="18" height="7" rx="1"/><path d="M7 6h1m-1 11h1"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Backend</h3></div>
                        <span class="expertise-subtitle">Server &amp; APIs</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>Node.js</li>
                        <li>Express</li>
                        <li>REST / GraphQL</li>
                        <li>WebSockets</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 4 16 4 16 0V5M4 12c0 4 16 4 16 0"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Databases</h3></div>
                        <span class="expertise-subtitle">Storage &amp; Caching</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>PostgreSQL</li>
                        <li>Redis</li>
                        <li>Prisma</li>
                        <li>Connection Pools</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-card-heading">
                        <span class="expertise-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
                        <div><h3>Tools &amp; DevOps</h3></div>
                        <span class="expertise-subtitle">Infra &amp; Quality</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="expertise-skills">
                        <li>Docker</li>
                        <li>AWS</li>
                        <li>CI/CD Pipelines</li>
                        <li>Jest / Vitest</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="featured-projects" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
            <div class="projects-heading">
                <div>
                    <div class="projects-eyebrow"><span class="projects-desktop-copy">Selected Works</span><span class="projects-tablet-copy">Production Systems</span></div>
                    <h2 id="projects-heading"><span class="projects-desktop-copy">Featured Engineering Projects</span><span class="projects-compact-copy">Featured Projects</span></h2>
                    <p class="projects-desktop-copy">Production systems built with Node.js, Express, React, and modern cloud infrastructure.</p>
                </div>
                <span class="projects-count projects-mobile-copy"><%= projects.length %> Selected</span>
            </div>
            <div class="projects-list">
                <% projects.forEach((project) => { %>
                    <article class="project-card" aria-labelledby="project-<%= project.id %>-heading">
                        <div class="project-visual">
                            <div class="project-image-frame">
                            <picture>
                                <source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)" srcset="<%= project.tablet.image %>">
                                <img src="<%= project.desktop.image %>" alt="<%= project.imageAlt %>" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                            </picture>
                            <div class="project-image-badge">
                                <% ['desktop', 'tablet', 'mobile'].forEach((layout) => { %>
                                    <span class="projects-<%= layout %>-copy"><%= project[layout].badge %></span>
                                <% }); %>
                            </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="project-details">
                            <div class="project-meta projects-desktop-copy"><span><%= project.category %></span><span><%= project.release %></span></div>
                            <h3 id="project-<%= project.id %>-heading">
                                <% ['desktop', 'tablet', 'mobile'].forEach((layout) => { %>
                                    <span class="projects-<%= layout %>-copy"><%= project[layout].title %></span>
                                <% }); %>
                            </h3>
                            <% ['desktop', 'tablet', 'mobile'].forEach((layout) => { %>
                                <div class="project-copy projects-<%= layout %>-copy">
                                    <p><%= project[layout].description %></p>
                                    <!-- <% if (project[layout].metrics.length) { %>
                                        <dl class="project-metrics">
                                            <% project[layout].metrics.forEach((metric) => { %>
                                                <div><dt><%= metric.label %></dt><dd><%= metric.value %></dd></div>
                                            <% }); %>
                                        </dl>
                                    <% } %> -->
                                    <ul class="project-technologies" aria-label="Technologies">
                                        <% project[layout].technologies.forEach((technology) => { %>
                                            <li><%= technology %></li>
                                        <% }); %>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            <% }); %>
                            <div class="project-actions">
                                <a class="project-action project-action-primary" <% if (project.demoUrl) { %>href="<%= project.demoUrl %>"<% } else { %>role="link" aria-disabled="true" title="Live demo coming soon"<% } %>>
                                    Live Demo
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3h7v7m0-7L10 14M10 3H3v18h18v-7"/></svg>
                                </a>
                                <a class="project-action project-action-source" <% if (project.sourceUrl) { %>href="<%= project.sourceUrl %>"<% } else { %>role="link" aria-disabled="true" title="Source repository coming soon"<% } %>>
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6m8-12 6 6-6 6m-3-15-2 18"/></svg>
                                    <span class="projects-desktop-copy">GitHub Source</span><span class="projects-compact-copy">GitHub</span>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                <% }); %>
            </div>
            <div class="projects-footer">
                <a class="project-action project-action-source projects-view-all" role="link" aria-disabled="true" title="All projects page coming soon">
                    View All Projects
                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
